<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Computer services cos started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Computer services cos started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns initiated coverage of several computer services companies, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- First Data Corp, Sabre Group Holdings Inc, Ceridian Corp, DST Systems Inc and BISYS Group Inc were started with buy ratings, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Electronic Data Systems Corp was started as attractive.</p>
<p>-- Computer Science Corp was started as neutral.  </p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
